PROJECT 'CURRENT' '001'
$ Box of 10 x 6 cells of 500 m, 20 m deep, with wind and boundary waves from
$ the west and a uniform current of (0.6, -0.3) m/s. With a current the
$ directions of a sweep differ per frequency; this deck is the straight box
$ of tests/test_dia_current_rotation.py (BF-71).
SET LEVEL 0.0 NAUTICAL
MODE STATIONARY TWODIMENSIONAL
COORDINATES CARTESIAN
CGRID REGULAR 0. 0. 0. 5000.0 3000.0 10 6 CIRCLE 36 0.04 1.0 24
INPGRID BOTTOM REGULAR 0. 0. 0. 1 1 5000.0 3000.0
READINP BOTTOM 1.0 'box.bot' 1 0 FREE
INPGRID CURRENT REGULAR 0. 0. 0. 1 1 5000.0 3000.0
READINP CURRENT 1.0 'current.dat' 1 0 FREE
WIND 15.0 270.0
BOUND SHAPESPEC JONSWAP 3.3 PEAK DSPR DEGREES
BOUNDSPEC SIDE WEST CONSTANT PAR 2.0 7.5 270.0 25.0
GEN3 KOMEN
BREAKING CONSTANT 1.0 0.73
FRICTION JONSWAP CONSTANT 0.038
BLOCK 'COMPGRID' NOHEADER 'current_box_hs.blk' LAYOUT 3 HSIGN
BLOCK 'COMPGRID' NOHEADER 'current_box_tm01.blk' LAYOUT 3 TM01
POINTS 'MID' 2500. 1500.
SPECOUT 'MID' SPEC2D ABSOLUTE 'current_box_mid.sp2'
NUMERIC STOPC NPNTS=101 STAT MXITST=20
COMPUTE
STOP
